    "Merlin.A02.OutOfGame": "Deploy a field of arcane energy. After a delay, the Vortex deals <keyword tag=\"Keyword.DamageMagical\">Magical Damage</> and <keyword tag=\"Keyword.CC.Hard.Knockback\">Pulls</> enemies towards the center.",
    "Merlin.B01.OutOfGame": "Channel a beam of intense fire for 2s that deals <keyword tag=\"Keyword.DamageMagical\">Magical Damage</> every 0.25s. \r\n• Each time Radiate hits an enemy, it also applies a Burn, dealing additional <keyword tag=\"Keyword.DamageMagical\">Magical Damage</> over time",
