    "Merlin.B02.OutOfGame": "Summon forth two ethereal dragons deal <keyword tag=\"Keyword.DamageMagical\">Magical Damage</> to enemies every 0.25s.\r\n• If caught in the center of the area, enemies are affliced by the Radiate Burn and gods have their <keyword tag=\"Keyword.Debuff\">Protections reduced</>.",
