    "Merlin.C01.OutOfGame": "Fire a Frostbolt that explodes when it hits an enemy, dealing <keyword tag=\"Keyword.DamageMagical\">Magical Damage</> in a small area.\r\n   • This ability deals an additional 15% damage if the enemy hit is slowed",
    "Merlin.C02.InGame.Short": "Create a Blizzard, dealing <keyword tag=\"Keyword.DamageMagical\">{Damage_Formula} [{Damage_Scaling_Percent}] Magical Damage</> repeatedly to enemies in an area.\r\n   • Enemies hit are debuffed with a stacking <keyword tag=\"Keyword.CC.Soft.Slow\">Slow</>",
    "Merlin.C02.InGame.Long": "This ability hits 8 times over 4s.",
    "Merlin.C02.OutOfGame": "Create a Blizzard, dealing <keyword tag=\"Keyword.DamageMagical\">Magical Damage</> repeatedly to enemies in an area.\r\n   • Enemies hit are debuffed with a stacking <keyword tag=\"Keyword.CC.Soft.Slow\">Slow</>",
    "Merlin.A04.InGame.Long": "Arcane - Enemies hit are <keyword tag=\"Keyword.CC.Hard.Knockback\">Knocked Up</>",
